As far as I know, later PWS models had flash space for both AlphaBios and
SRM, though "A" models had only Alphabios factory istalled. You can easily
download and run firmware upgrade from Compaq ftp site, which
upgrades/installs both SRM and AlphaBios (I've done this on my PWS433a).
