My guess is that you have a Powerstorm video card in your system. This
will not work with linux. Get a Matrox Millennium video card. For now
you could try installation in 
the text mode -- add  word text at the end of boot flags. Something
like:
for RH6.2
boot dka0 -file /kernels/generic.gz -flags "root=/dev/scd0 text"

and for RH7.0
boot dka0 -file /kernels/vmlinux.gz -flags "root=/dev/scd0 
initrd=images/ramdisk.img text"
The names of kernels are different on CDs as far as I remember.

Don't install X server until you get the right video card.

Good luck!
--Zufar


