You seem to have an invalid CD, there; it appears that rather than
having burned the ISO image, you have burned an ISO image that
_contains_ an ISO image.

Try mounting that CD on an IA-32-based system (Windows or Linux;
doesn't much matter); if it consists of one big file, "incomple.iso",
then your problem is basically that you need to burn a CD based on the
ISO image, rather than one that is a filesystem _containing_ the ISO
image.

